    "title": "Reference self, manner and reasons",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk2-pronouns-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Reference self, manner and reasons",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "自己 refers back to the relevant person. 这么/那么 describe degree or manner; 这样/那样 refer to a way or situation. 每 distributes over a set.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我自己去。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ zìjǐ qù 。",
                "meaning": "I will go myself.",
                "audio": "e3d0e2e3491fd013fdb21ea1c8ca69097ebf411256a0a604482c392fac5a0d0d"
              },
              {
                "text": "你为什么这样做？",
                "pinyin": "nǐ wèishénme zhèyàng zuò ？",
                "meaning": "Why do you do it this way?",
                "audio": "835a2e0a8f846021374bca68eadcb55265f1995ac11a75399f5b072fe10256c3"
              },
              {
                "text": "他每天都来。",
                "pinyin": "tā měi tiān dōu lái 。",
                "meaning": "He comes every day.",
                "audio": "12979e49a8169f133ed6a1a72024ff5b11ad60eb95005143cf2e1cff1012d05c"
              },
              {
                "text": "不要那么忙。",
                "pinyin": "bùyào nàme máng 。",
                "meaning": "Do not be so busy.",
                "audio": "ae1e3ef5ab2c0b1c6e59ab4e0352c272262d03de21380d75d8d8a160c107dadc"
              }
            ]
